  "layers": [
    "base"
  ],
  "out_of_scope": [
    "No SHIFT layer: the DJM-A9 has no SHIFT button and the MIDI list documents no +SHIFT rows",
    "Rotary selectors (C1 INPUT, R14 SEND CH, R25 EFFECT SELECT) join one representative position; every position stays in midi.json",
    "R18 X-PAD joins its slide CC; the touch CC stays in midi.json",
    "R27 TIME joins its MSB CC; the LSB CC stays in midi.json",
    "Controls the MIDI list does not document: MIC LEVEL 1 and 2, +48V, MIDI ON/OFF and START/STOP, CENTER LOCK, level meters, display",
    "No MIDI input: the list has no MIDI-OUT column, so there are no LED rows"
  ],
